---
---
<section class="py-24 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-100">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      
      {/* Kiri: Deskripsi & Legitimasi */}
      <div>
        <span class="text-primary font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-sm mb-2 block">Profil Perusahaan</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Profil Workshop Cilodong Depok</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          <strong>Hafshi Jaya Konveksi</strong> berdedikasi menjadi partner pengadaan pakaian seragam dan apparel terpercaya. Workshop kami berlokasi di Cilodong, Depok, dan dilengkapi dengan alat jahit yang memadai untuk melayani pemesanan ke seluruh pelosok Nusantara.
        </p>
        
        <div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="mt-1 bg-green-100 text-green-600 rounded-full p-1">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-700">Berpengalaman melayani instansi pemerintah dan perusahaan swasta.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="mt-1 bg-green-100 text-green-600 rounded-full p-1">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-700">Menyediakan dokumen penawaran harga dan legalitas usaha untuk keperluan tender/purchasing.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <div class="mt-1 bg-green-100 text-green-600 rounded-full p-1">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-700">Dukungan Quality Control (QC) ketat pada setiap tahap produksi.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <a href="/tentang-kami" class="btn btn-primary shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">Pelajari Lebih Lanjut Tentang Kami</a>
      </div>
      
      {/* Kanan: Fasilitas Visual */}
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-slate-200 rounded-2xl h-48 md:h-64 flex flex-col items-center justify-center border border-slate-100 p-4 text-center overflow-hidden relative shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-slate-400 mb-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M14 10l-2 1m0 0l-2-1m2 1v2.5M20 7l-2 1m2-1l-2-1m2 1v2.5M14 4l-2-1-2 1M4 7l2-1M4 7l2 1M4 7v2.5M12 21l-2-1m2 1l2-1m-2 1v-2.5M6 18l-2-1v-2.5M18 18l2-1v-2.5"></path></svg>
          <span class="font-medium text-slate-600 text-sm">Meja Potong Presisi</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-200 rounded-2xl h-48 md:h-64 flex flex-col items-center justify-center border border-slate-100 p-4 text-center overflow-hidden relative shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow mt-8">
          <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-slate-400 mb-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"></path></svg>
          <span class="font-medium text-slate-600 text-sm">Mesin Jahit High-Speed</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-200 rounded-2xl h-48 md:h-64 flex flex-col items-center justify-center border border-slate-100 p-4 text-center overflow-hidden relative shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow -mt-8">
          <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-slate-400 mb-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M5.121 17.804A13.937 13.937 0 0112 16c2.5 0 4.847.655 6.879 1.804M15 10a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
          <span class="font-medium text-slate-600 text-sm">Tenaga Penjahit Ahli</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-200 rounded-2xl h-48 md:h-64 flex flex-col items-center justify-center border border-slate-100 p-4 text-center overflow-hidden relative shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-slate-400 mb-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M7 21a4 4 0 01-4-4V5a2 2 0 012-2h4a2 2 0 012 2v12a4 4 0 01-4 4zm0 0h12a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2.343M11 7.343l1.657-1.657a2 2 0 012.828 0l2.829 2.829a2 2 0 010 2.828l-8.486 8.485M7 17h.01"></path></svg>
          <span class="font-medium text-slate-600 text-sm">Bordir & Sablon Kualitas Tinggi</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
